Creating the Shortcut

Right-click a blank spot on your desktop.
Choose New and then click Shortcut.
Type or paste ms-settings:windowsupdate in the text box.
Click Next.
Type a name like Windows Update for your new file.
Click Finish to place the icon on your desktop

Change the icon: 
Right-click the shortcut, 
pick Properties, 
go to the shortcut or web document tab, 
and click Change Icon to pick a new look
